_Press_release_v9.pdf","ts":"2026-04-23T17:01"},{"k":"call","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_24042026202610_AESL_-_Audio.pdf","ts":"2026-04-24T20:26"},{"k":"transcript","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_30042026170040_AESLTRANSCRIPT.pdf","ts":"2026-04-30T17:02"}]},{"q":"FY27Q1","ql":"Q1 FY27","basis":"consolidated","rev":9711.1,"ebitda":3008.4,"pat":1149.1,"eps":9.57,"m":31.0,"m_y":-296.0,"rev_y":42.4,"rev_q":30.5,"ebitda_y":30.0,"pat_y":124.2,"pat_q":68.0,"label":"Good","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/INTEGRATED_FILING_INDAS_1698890_21072026081419_WEB.xml","ev":{"ts":"2026-07-21T13:56:49","src":"NSE announcement","day":0.7,"w1":-5.3,"m1":-11.5},"docs":[{"k":"result","t":"Outcome of Board Meeting","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_21072026135501_Outcome_results_21072026.pdf","ts":"2026-07-21T13:56"},{"k":"press","t":"Press Release","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_21072026185122_Press_release.pdf","ts":"2026-07-21T18:51"},{"k":"call","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_22072026200110_AESL_-_Audio.pdf","ts":"2026-07-22T20:01"},{"k":"press","t":"Press Release","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_24072026142251_AESL_MEDIA_RELEASE.pdf","ts":"2026-07-24T14:23"},{"k":"transcript","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","ts":"2026-07-28T20:08"}],"cm":{"items":[{"field":"improved","statement":"Transmission and energy solutions experienced significant growth during the first quarter, while distribution and smart metering grew steadily.","quote":"In quarter 1, as you must have seen from the numbers, we have seen significant growth in transmission and energy solutions, and distribution and smart metering is growing at a stable pace.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Operating revenue from commissioned smart meters grew to INR 166 crores compared to INR 68 crores in the prior quarter.","quote":"Essentially, what Prashant is saying, the revenue from commission meter, which is operating revenue, has increased to INR166 crores from last quarter of INR68 crores.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":16.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects all four operating business verticals to deliver consistent results quarter-on-quarter.","quote":"And with all these 4 business firing on all cylinders and with all of our future growth locked in, now we are -- you will see the numbers and results consistently quarter-on-quarter.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"The company anticipates an annual bidding opportunity of around INR 1 lakh crore across central and state transmission projects.","quote":"And as far as pipeline is concerned, you must have seen all those NCT approved by -- other things. So, we expect that every year, we would have an opportunity of about INR1 lakh crores bidding","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":14.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"AESL expects to sustain a market share of approximately 25%, resulting in roughly INR 20,000 crore to INR 25,000 crore of capex additions annually.","quote":"See, Aditya, we have been doing a market share of about 25%. And we will at least continue that part from our side. So roughly about INR20,000 crores, INR25,000 crores of capex addition every year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":14.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"The company completed nearly INR 3,500 crore of capital expenditure during the quarter.","quote":"One significant thing is that we delivered a quarterly capex of about -- close to INR3,500 crores of capex. And that is what we are focusing and we will continue to focus","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Power demand and market prices were elevated during the period due to a delayed monsoon.","quote":"Obviously, this year, because of a delayed monsoon, the demand was high and then the market prices were also high as compared to the last year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Bilateral contract power prices range between INR 3 and INR 15 depending on whether the power is sold individually or as bundled power.","quote":"And even those prices are also very different because sometimes we sell it as a bundled power, sometimes we sell it as an individual. So those prices are ranging from INR3 to INR13 or INR15 as well.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"The company focuses on maintaining execution and capital discipline to reduce its cost of capital during this high-growth phase.","quote":"Besides scaling up all these 4 business verticals, we continue to make sure that our execution discipline and capital discipline are maintained even in this high-growth period and thereby, reducing our cost of capital","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Margins are higher for contracted capacity positions relative to fee-based power solution services.","quote":"So typically, those margins on those capacities where we are taking the position would be higher, whereas on the services side, we'll be taking the service as is.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"AESL secured around 5,000 megawatts of predominantly green energy supply capacity on the supply side.","quote":"So we tied up about 5,000 megawatts of capacity on a supply side. And these are mainly green energy supply. And we are now also tying up with various consumers.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"The company has installed 13.4 million smart meters cumulatively against its total order book of 24.6 million meters.","quote":"We have also now completed the smart meter installation of 1.34 crores or 13.4 million meters cumulatively on the order book of 2.46 crores or 24.6 million.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The acquisition of IntelliSmart will increase AESL's combined smart metering portfolio to approximately 47 million meters.","quote":"In addition, you must have seen the news that we are acquiring IntelliSmart. And combined IntelliSmart and AESL, we'll have a portfolio of about 4.7 crores or 47 million meters.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"Substantial interstate transmission expansion over the last four to five years now requires state utilities to augment their internal transmission networks.","quote":"See essentially, what has happened in last 4, 5 years, a lot of interstate line has been built to deliver power to the state. Now state will have to augment their transmission capacity within the state","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":14.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"coupled with our execution record and with energy solutions, we hope that we will continue to do better in terms of results and businesses. So we remain confident delivering sustained and compounding value for all stakeholders.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_28072026200812_AESL_Intimation_of_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"}],"kpis":[]}},{"q":"FY27Q2","ql":"Q2 FY27","basis":"consolidated","rev":10075.5,"ebitda":3100.7,"pat":1322.8,"eps":11.01,"m":30.8,"m_y":-393.0,"rev_y":52.8,"rev_q":3.8,"ebitda_y":35.5,"pat_y":147.7,"pat_q":15.1,"label":"Good","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/INTEGRATED_FILING_INDAS_1744019_22102026051209_WEB.xml","ev":{"ts":"2026-10-22T14:47:54","src":"NSE announcement","day":-2.2},"docs":[{"k":"result","t":"Outcome of Board Meeting","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANITRANS_22102026144617_UFR_FINAL.pdf","ts":"2026-10-22T14:47"},{"k":"press","t":"Press Release","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate